# Sunyshore Market's seal merchant (decomp scripts_sunyshore_market.s SunyshoreMarket_SealShop, docs/research/seals.md
# §4.2) on a Monday: the day's stock (MART_SEAL_ID_SUNYSHORE_MONDAY: seal 1 first), three Heart Seal A bought into the
# Seal Case, the money and RECORD_MONEY_SPENT; the Seal Case at 99 refuses more. The save keeps them.
date 2009-03-23 12:00
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_STARAVIA 20 platinum:MOVE_WING_ATTACK
give item platinum:ITEM_SEAL_CASE 1
set money 10000
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_SUNYSHORE_MARKET 1 6 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app mart 300
+0 assert state app.seals true
+0 assert state app.menu.length 2
+1 tap menu:0
+1 assert state app.rows[0].item "seal:1"
+1 assert state app.rows.length 7
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap qty:+1
+1 tap qty:+1
+1 tap ok
+1 tap yes
+1 assert state sealCase.counts[0] 3
+0 assert text platinum:pl_msg_00000543_00013 0
+1 tap next
+0 assert state money 9850
+0 assert state records.counts["35"] 150
# 96 more Heart Seal A fill the case; one more is refused before the question (pl_msg_00000543_00014).
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap qty:+10
+1 tap qty:+10
+1 tap qty:+10
+1 tap qty:+10
+1 tap qty:+10
+1 tap qty:+10
+1 tap qty:+10
+1 tap qty:+10
+1 tap qty:+10
+1 tap qty:+1
+1 tap qty:+1
+1 tap qty:+1
+1 tap qty:+1
+1 tap qty:+1
+1 assert state sealCase.counts[0] 3
+1 tap ok
+1 tap yes
+1 tap next
+1 assert state sealCase.counts[0] 99
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap ok
+1 assert text platinum:pl_msg_00000543_00014 0
+1 tap next
+1 assert state sealCase.counts[0] 99
+1 tap cancel
+1 tap menu:1
+1 tap next
until app none 60
advance text
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state sealCase.counts[0] 99
